# Facts of the retry verdict (bridge_retry.RetryPolicy.decide and the SENT boundary of bridge._send_with_retry). The host folds are mechanical: isinstance, a clock compare, the probe reads.
# retryGate reads only the cheap facts. retryReason is asked only when retryGate says observe, and reads the probes: probeBusy is CompileStateProbe.has_strong_busy_signal (state file, pid, a TCP connect, Editor.log).
CONTRACT unitymcp.retry
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE retry_facts
FACT retry.errorKind enum=identityMismatch,capacityBusy,domainReload,connectionRefused,other closed
FACT retry.attempt number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT retry.maxRetries number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT retry.deadlinePassed bool
FACT retry.deliverySent bool
FACT retry.retrySafe bool
FACT retry.reloadActive bool
FACT retry.probeBusy bool
FACT retry.processDead bool
INPUT retryGate retry.errorKind retry.attempt retry.maxRetries retry.deadlinePassed retry.deliverySent retry.retrySafe retry.reloadActive
INPUT retryReason retry.errorKind retry.attempt retry.probeBusy retry.processDead
